# API

- FastAPI + Uvicorn on port 3001
- Import contracts from `terrarium_contracts`, never duplicate DTOs
- Long work is Redis/ARQ (P1-S4). Do not run LLM agents inline in the HTTP handler
- Do not import React. Talk to Docker only through `packages/sandbox`
